WEBVTT

00:50.008 --> 00:52.761
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS, RELIGIONS,

00:52.844 --> 00:55.680
EVENTS, AND OCCUPATIONS
IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

01:00.602 --> 01:01.811
Sang-hee.

01:04.647 --> 01:08.401
Oh Joo-hyung, you're under arrest
for the charges of murdering your wife.

01:12.155 --> 01:14.407
- Let me talk to her for a moment.
- Take your time.

01:15.408 --> 01:17.619
How could you kill your wife?

01:17.702 --> 01:19.662
You do look like a wife-killer, though.

01:27.378 --> 01:29.172
Thank you for your cooperation.

01:29.255 --> 01:31.674
He said he'd get divorced,
so I trusted him.

01:31.758 --> 01:33.426
But this is what happened.

01:34.594 --> 01:37.472
Come with us to
the police station as a witness.

01:37.555 --> 01:39.849
You can testify about what happened.

01:40.809 --> 01:42.227
Later.

01:42.310 --> 01:43.269
I…

01:44.229 --> 01:45.939
I don't think I can do it right now.

01:46.898 --> 01:49.359
I'll take my stuff and leave.

01:50.026 --> 01:50.944
Sure.

02:09.254 --> 02:11.881
SAE-BOM

02:16.678 --> 02:17.804
Hey, Sae-bom.

02:17.887 --> 02:18.888
Where are you?

02:18.972 --> 02:20.557
I'm locked up inside.

02:20.640 --> 02:23.518
Don't fight them trying to get in.

02:23.601 --> 02:25.979
If my mom calls you, tell her I'm okay.

02:26.062 --> 02:28.356
What does that mean?
Where are you locked up at?

02:29.232 --> 02:30.275
I'll be

02:31.484 --> 02:32.819
watching our apartment.

02:32.902 --> 02:36.156
Sae-bom, tell me what's going on.

02:37.657 --> 02:38.616
Damn it.

02:42.453 --> 02:43.955
I was going to tell you later…

02:51.170 --> 02:53.172
I thought I was left alone.

03:00.388 --> 03:03.266
Sae-bom, I have to catch that jerk.

03:03.349 --> 03:06.603
It's okay. No one can get out.

03:21.367 --> 03:22.577
Who is this?

03:22.660 --> 03:24.579
Hi, did you order rice cakes?

03:25.538 --> 03:27.624
Enjoy and order more, okay?

03:29.334 --> 03:30.877
Are you a police officer too?

03:30.960 --> 03:31.920
How did you know?

03:32.837 --> 03:34.547
You saw this.

03:35.423 --> 03:37.383
I'm not someone suspicious.

03:37.467 --> 03:39.052
I'm friends with your neighbor.

03:39.928 --> 03:41.721
So you have two jobs.

03:42.305 --> 03:44.057
But why did you bring a gun?

03:44.140 --> 03:47.352
Someone bad lives here,
so I'm going to arrest him.

03:47.435 --> 03:50.396
People need to see my gun
to know that I'm a police officer.

03:50.480 --> 03:53.441
- Can I see it up close?
- No, it's dangerous.

03:55.360 --> 03:58.613
To be honest, I've never actually used it.

03:58.696 --> 04:00.240
I'm just carrying it around.

04:01.032 --> 04:02.909
Because it looks awesome, doesn't it?

04:06.120 --> 04:07.372
I'm home.

04:10.708 --> 04:12.210
Are you dead?

04:12.293 --> 04:14.629
You don't even look at me when I'm back.

04:15.463 --> 04:17.298
Hey, here's your hamburger.

04:19.592 --> 04:22.428
And you get up right away because of food!

04:23.596 --> 04:25.181
Thanks.

04:25.765 --> 04:27.308
You said it's a hamburger.

04:27.392 --> 04:30.019
It's still bread. What's the problem?

04:30.103 --> 04:31.813
If you don't want it, then forget it.

04:33.356 --> 04:35.817
Honey, I'm not saying that
I don't want it…

04:35.900 --> 04:37.652
Did it get chapped again?

04:37.735 --> 04:38.569
No.

04:39.654 --> 04:40.947
My goodness.

04:41.572 --> 04:44.325
Apply something on it! You're old now!

04:44.409 --> 04:47.036
No, it didn't get chapped. This is…

04:47.120 --> 04:49.622
I sprained it a bit when I fell yesterday.

04:50.206 --> 04:51.374
Don't overreact.

04:51.457 --> 04:56.963
Honey, aren't you even curious
about what happened? I got hurt.

05:00.341 --> 05:01.968
Did something happen?

05:02.051 --> 05:03.094
Yes.

05:03.177 --> 05:06.222
Yesterday, on the sixth floor…

05:06.306 --> 05:08.975
Mom, why didn't you wake me up?
I have a meeting!

05:09.934 --> 05:13.604
Hey, how are we supposed
to know about your appointments?

05:13.688 --> 05:15.440
We're not telepathic!

05:15.523 --> 05:17.734
Dong-hyun, want this sandwich?

05:18.484 --> 05:20.445
You two eat it and live a happy life.

05:20.528 --> 05:22.196
Hey, take this…

05:22.864 --> 05:24.741
That rude brat!

05:25.867 --> 05:28.036
Good grief.

05:36.252 --> 05:37.587
I MADE MONEY THROUGH YOUTUBE!

05:37.670 --> 05:38.796
What in the world…

05:43.509 --> 05:47.305
I got more than 1,000 subscribers.
At this rate, we can surely make a profit!

05:48.097 --> 05:51.392
No, you just need to pay the initial cost!
Can't you trust me?

05:52.477 --> 05:53.519
All right.

05:53.603 --> 05:55.772
I'll be there soon. All right.

06:07.617 --> 06:10.036
Why can't I go out? Hey, mister!

06:10.119 --> 06:11.162
What the heck?

06:13.206 --> 06:15.583
I can't believe this.

06:19.462 --> 06:20.797
Can't you hear me?

06:20.880 --> 06:23.883
What's going on?
I don't have time for this!

06:33.601 --> 06:36.145
- Even the smallest room is pretty big.
- It is.

06:40.274 --> 06:43.778
SY HOME CLEANING

06:48.241 --> 06:49.450
Nice weather.

06:51.828 --> 06:52.954
You can't smoke indoors.

06:54.413 --> 06:56.165
This is an electronic cigarette.

07:10.930 --> 07:14.434
Happy now? Are you satisfied?

07:18.729 --> 07:20.064
Jeez…

07:21.232 --> 07:23.484
Honey, can't we fire him?

07:24.152 --> 07:25.611
He's weird.

07:26.195 --> 07:28.114
Just let him be.

07:29.490 --> 07:32.368
He doesn't mind getting paid
lower than the minimum wage.

07:34.579 --> 07:35.663
His name is weird too.

07:36.330 --> 07:37.248
Andrew?

07:37.874 --> 07:39.417
Is that a fake name or what?

07:39.500 --> 07:41.377
Seriously.

07:57.226 --> 07:59.353
That's been going on since this morning.

08:00.938 --> 08:02.106
Is there a fire?

08:02.607 --> 08:04.066
If it was a fire,
we would have known already.

08:05.026 --> 08:06.652
I've been in a fire before.

08:06.736 --> 08:08.738
You don’t know unless you smell it.

08:08.821 --> 08:10.323
Your house caught on fire?

08:10.406 --> 08:11.449
Yes.

08:11.532 --> 08:13.659
I heard the sirens outside,

08:13.743 --> 08:15.828
and the fire trucks
were lined up on the road.

08:15.912 --> 08:18.789
I opened the window
and looked around to see where it was,

08:18.873 --> 08:21.667
and someone from the apartment
across the street yelled at me.

08:22.251 --> 08:24.712
- What did they say?
- "Young lady, come out!"

08:24.795 --> 08:26.047
"Your apartment is on fire!"

08:27.048 --> 08:30.009
The top floor of
my apartment building was on fire.

08:30.843 --> 08:34.722
It's clearly visible from the outside,
but you don't know when you're inside.

08:35.932 --> 08:37.475
No way.

08:50.154 --> 08:51.948
Hello, this is Lawyer Kook Hae-seong.

08:52.031 --> 08:54.784
Hi, I'm your next-door neighbor. Unit 601.

08:54.867 --> 08:58.037
I need urgent legal consulting…

08:58.120 --> 09:00.206
Yes, hi.

09:00.289 --> 09:03.834
You must be worried
because of your wife, right?

09:03.918 --> 09:05.836
I'm home now. Are you home?

09:05.920 --> 09:08.589
Would you like me to go to your house?

09:08.673 --> 09:12.134
No, I'm outside right now.

09:12.218 --> 09:13.386
I see. Okay.

09:13.469 --> 09:16.389
Then please tell me. What's going on?

09:16.472 --> 09:19.392
The police arrested me without a warrant,

09:19.475 --> 09:22.979
but an arrest without
a warrant is illegal, right?

09:24.897 --> 09:26.566
What are you being charged with?

09:26.649 --> 09:28.025
Murder.

09:30.570 --> 09:32.446
You evaded arrest and escaped, right?

09:33.322 --> 09:35.575
Help me, please!

09:35.658 --> 09:37.451
I live in Building 101.

09:37.535 --> 09:39.495
I'm a doctor! A specialist!

09:39.579 --> 09:41.914
We're from the police.
You can just keep going.

09:41.998 --> 09:43.457
Young lady. Or old lady?

09:43.541 --> 09:44.959
Anyway, he's your husband?

09:45.042 --> 09:47.628
I'm going to report you
for human rights violations.

09:50.381 --> 09:52.967
What are you waiting for?
Hit him where it won't show.

09:55.970 --> 09:56.804
Just come with me.

09:58.848 --> 10:00.474
And put your shoes on.

10:06.188 --> 10:07.481
They're locking us up?

10:07.565 --> 10:09.483
- I can't believe it…
- What are they doing?

10:09.567 --> 10:11.861
- Why did they set those up?
- What's going on?

10:11.944 --> 10:14.280
- This is so scary.
- They're so big.

10:15.406 --> 10:16.532
This is nonsense.

10:37.386 --> 10:39.347
I'm so disappointed in you.

10:40.264 --> 10:42.600
Hey, I'm your only older brother,

10:43.517 --> 10:45.311
and you can't even give me 150 million?

10:45.394 --> 10:46.479
I have no money.

10:46.562 --> 10:48.314
You do have money.

10:48.397 --> 10:50.775
You know what the price for this place is.

10:50.858 --> 10:54.403
- You won the lottery.
- Are they doing construction work outside?

10:54.487 --> 10:55.905
Or how about we live together?

10:57.365 --> 11:00.910
It would be great for my kids
to study in a house like this.

11:01.494 --> 11:04.330
You have a lot of rooms.
Give one each to my kids.

11:04.413 --> 11:06.999
And honestly, you get lonely
when you live alone.

11:07.083 --> 11:10.169
Have you heard of lonely death?

11:10.252 --> 11:11.462
Yes.

11:11.545 --> 11:12.880
That's why I read newspapers.

11:12.963 --> 11:14.715
So people can find out when I die.

11:14.799 --> 11:18.177
To be honest, you've been living here
with Father's deposit.

11:18.260 --> 11:20.388
And thanks to that, you got the house.

11:20.471 --> 11:23.557
But you inherited the fortune,
in cash and lands!

11:23.641 --> 11:25.476
But I got them ten years ago.

11:26.143 --> 11:28.854
- Ever heard of inflation?
- Be quiet.

11:28.938 --> 11:30.898
Greetings, all residents of Building 101.

11:30.981 --> 11:32.900
I am the building representative.

11:32.983 --> 11:36.570
I'm sure you are confused
because of all the noise.

11:37.279 --> 11:40.950
The entire apartment complex
is now separated from the outside.

11:41.033 --> 11:42.618
- What?
- And the government

11:42.701 --> 11:45.621
has something to tell us
about Mad Human Disease.

11:45.704 --> 11:49.542
A resident meeting will take place
at the basement gym at five.

11:49.625 --> 11:52.795
With the government admitting the
existence of Mad Human Disease,

11:52.878 --> 11:55.464
three nursing homes,
two homeless facilities,

11:55.548 --> 11:57.383
and one apartment complex in Seyang

11:57.466 --> 12:00.428
have been put into cohort isolation
due to Mad Human Disease.

12:01.178 --> 12:03.431
Hey, was it like that when you came in?

12:03.514 --> 12:04.640
Yes.

12:04.723 --> 12:07.268
I thought they were
just doing construction work.

12:07.351 --> 12:08.394
The government revealed

12:08.477 --> 12:11.439
that it was an inevitable action
to prevent additional infections,

12:11.522 --> 12:14.233
and stated that they will prevent
the spreading of infection

12:14.316 --> 12:17.987
through accurate diagnostic tests
and establishing countermeasures.

12:18.070 --> 12:19.655
I'm sure we can get out, though.

12:20.739 --> 12:22.533
Nice place.

12:29.331 --> 12:32.376
- My mom is inside.
- Let me go in just for a moment.

12:32.460 --> 12:34.086
- No.
- My kid is all alone.

12:49.393 --> 12:50.811
Your mom must be worried too.

12:51.562 --> 12:53.355
But she'll call you soon, so…

12:55.357 --> 12:57.443
- Mom?
- Seo-yoon, are you okay?

12:57.526 --> 13:01.280
- Did anything happen to you?
- No. I'm at our neighbor's.

13:01.363 --> 13:03.324
I'm in front of the apartments.

13:03.407 --> 13:06.327
I'll go inside somehow,
so just hang in there.

13:07.077 --> 13:10.789
They're not letting anyone out,
but letting people in won't be a problem.

13:10.873 --> 13:11.916
Okay.

13:11.999 --> 13:15.169
Can I speak to that lady
if she's with you?

13:24.303 --> 13:25.221
Hello?

13:28.140 --> 13:30.768
I'm so glad we have you.

13:30.851 --> 13:31.894
Thank you so much.

13:33.187 --> 13:35.648
I'll be heading inside soon.

13:35.731 --> 13:38.567
Please take care of Seo-yoon
for a little while longer.

13:38.651 --> 13:40.110
Don't worry.

13:40.694 --> 13:42.863
I love hanging out with Seo-yoon too.

13:42.947 --> 13:43.906
Seo-yoon…

13:44.823 --> 13:46.992
has a heart problem.

13:47.076 --> 13:49.161
She has mitral regurgitation.

13:49.995 --> 13:51.872
Blood wells up inside her heart.

13:51.956 --> 13:55.834
She must never do vigorous exercise,
and she must never bleed.

13:55.918 --> 13:57.836
Last time, she injured her fingernail

13:57.920 --> 14:00.506
and she was hospitalized
and got an antibiotics injection.

14:00.589 --> 14:01.840
I will watch over her.

14:01.924 --> 14:04.635
I couldn't stay with her
just because of some money…

14:06.053 --> 14:08.305
I got a call earlier,
but I couldn't answer.

14:09.807 --> 14:12.726
I will try and find out
if there's a way to let Seo-yoon out.

14:13.894 --> 14:15.354
Thank you so much.

14:15.938 --> 14:17.940
It's not your fault.

14:18.023 --> 14:20.776
Don't worry, I'll take good care of her.

14:21.443 --> 14:22.486
Okay.

14:38.752 --> 14:42.798
Mom, can I eat the rice cakes?

14:52.641 --> 14:54.268
MS. KIM BOK-NAM

14:56.520 --> 14:57.479
Hi, Mom.

14:57.563 --> 15:00.024
You said you're okay. What's going on?

15:00.107 --> 15:02.318
That's your apartment
getting locked down, right?

15:02.401 --> 15:05.821
It's a preemptive action
to control the infections. Don’t worry.

15:05.905 --> 15:08.532
They say many people got infected,
so just stay home.

15:08.616 --> 15:09.950
Don't go poking around.

15:10.910 --> 15:13.203
I want to stay put, but…

15:17.124 --> 15:19.376
someone has to do something.

15:19.460 --> 15:22.004
- What?
- I'm busy. I'll call you later.

15:23.839 --> 15:25.424
LIEUTENANT COLONEL HAN TAE-SEOK

15:29.470 --> 15:30.387
Lieutenant Colonel?

15:31.221 --> 15:32.431
We need to meet.

15:33.432 --> 15:36.143
What do you mean, when?
As soon as possible.

15:39.313 --> 15:41.440
You knew your wife
was taking drugs, right?

15:41.523 --> 15:43.275
Did you take that drug too?

15:45.569 --> 15:48.864
Did Min-ji become like that
because of drugs?

15:50.783 --> 15:53.118
You can't run away now anyway,

15:53.202 --> 15:54.620
so just stay here quietly.

15:55.204 --> 15:58.123
If you want to consult a lawyer,
then do so.

16:02.211 --> 16:03.379
What about me?

16:03.462 --> 16:05.214
I'm not even a resident here.

16:06.006 --> 16:08.092
No one can go out, and no one can come in.

16:09.802 --> 16:12.346
You're a police officer.
Can't you do something?

16:12.429 --> 16:14.098
I can't get out, either.

16:17.351 --> 16:20.020
Anyway, there's a resident meeting.
Come with us.

16:20.104 --> 16:20.980
No.

16:21.563 --> 16:23.649
I'm sure everyone knows
what happened here.

16:23.732 --> 16:25.526
What would the others think about me?

16:25.609 --> 16:28.153
Then would you like
to stay here with Mr. Oh?

16:37.287 --> 16:38.163
Hang on.

16:51.135 --> 16:53.512
What now? What?

17:01.103 --> 17:03.397
I'm worried about Ms. Woo, that's why.

17:04.356 --> 17:06.608
I'll uncuff this later, so get some sleep.

17:08.027 --> 17:09.945
Why would you do this?

17:10.029 --> 17:12.740
Why are you doing this to me?

17:12.823 --> 17:15.367
Then what about the bathroom?

17:16.368 --> 17:17.995
Should I just pee in the room?

17:24.835 --> 17:26.336
Make sure you don't spill.

17:30.466 --> 17:31.967
Damn it.

17:39.641 --> 17:40.476
You're not going?

17:41.143 --> 17:43.353
I want to go too, but…

17:43.437 --> 17:45.522
you know how sensitive I am.

17:45.606 --> 17:49.026
If I go to a crowded place
with Mad Human Disease going around,

17:49.109 --> 17:52.196
I can't use 100% of my abilities.

17:52.780 --> 17:55.491
Then what about me?
You think I'm not scared?

17:55.574 --> 17:57.951
That's why I only trust you.

17:58.035 --> 18:00.913
Clients will line up on days like this.

18:00.996 --> 18:05.000
This lockdown has
a high possibility of legal issues.

18:05.084 --> 18:07.920
Okay. I'll go and promote you.

18:08.921 --> 18:10.798
- So-yoon.
- Yes?

18:11.381 --> 18:12.341
You can do it!

18:20.891 --> 18:22.142
Hi.

18:23.936 --> 18:26.814
I heard you arrested the man next door.

18:26.897 --> 18:28.440
Where is he now?

18:30.067 --> 18:31.485
He's at home.

18:33.153 --> 18:34.530
Because of the lockdown.

18:34.613 --> 18:38.617
I cuffed him, so tell him to go
and consult him if he wants to.

18:39.701 --> 18:43.330
Is there evidence for murder?

18:43.413 --> 18:45.833
You should ask Mr. Oh about that yourself.

18:46.792 --> 18:48.293
But if I were you two,

18:49.670 --> 18:50.796
I wouldn't defend him.

18:58.762 --> 18:59.638
Sang-hee.

19:00.264 --> 19:02.391
Sang-hee. You're out there, right?

19:02.474 --> 19:04.059
We need to talk!

19:04.143 --> 19:06.603
We're soulmates! Come on!

19:06.687 --> 19:07.563
No.

19:08.897 --> 19:11.483
Do you think you can be happy on your own?

19:12.359 --> 19:16.405
Everyone knows we had an affair,
and you're locked up in here.

19:16.488 --> 19:19.032
You have no money,
and you'll get fired from the clinic.

19:19.116 --> 19:22.744
I am the only one
who understands you, Sang-hee.

19:23.871 --> 19:26.957
You know me, right?

19:27.499 --> 19:30.919
Sang-hee, I'll give you money. Okay?

19:32.504 --> 19:33.338
Sang-hee.

19:34.840 --> 19:36.383
How much are you going to give me?

19:53.567 --> 19:57.446
Hi, I'm the wife
of Lawyer Kook Hae-seong, Unit 602.

19:57.529 --> 20:00.949
If you have legal problems,
please call this number.

20:03.577 --> 20:05.579
He said he doesn't know
anything about drugs.

20:05.662 --> 20:09.333
He got all upset,
saying that he doesn't use steroids.

20:21.929 --> 20:24.264
Is the meeting just for our building?

20:24.348 --> 20:26.308
Just the units that end with 1 and 2.

20:26.391 --> 20:28.060
Looks like we're meeting separately.

20:40.864 --> 20:43.575
Dear residents of Seyang Forest Le Ciel.

20:44.201 --> 20:47.579
Due to the dangers of
additional infections in the complex,

20:47.663 --> 20:50.916
the entire complex will be
in cohort isolation for one week.

20:50.999 --> 20:53.543
Hey, young lady!

20:53.627 --> 20:55.712
I don’t even live here!
Am I locked up too?

20:55.796 --> 20:58.298
We will compensate for all damages caused

20:58.382 --> 21:02.010
by the lockdown
until we can manage all the infected.

21:02.094 --> 21:03.011
I'm not talking about that…

21:03.095 --> 21:06.765
We will make sure
you won't suffer any inconvenience,

21:06.848 --> 21:08.350
so please wait until then.

21:08.433 --> 21:10.560
And if you need anything else,

21:10.644 --> 21:13.272
discuss it among the residents
and let us know.

21:13.355 --> 21:14.564
That will be all.

21:14.648 --> 21:18.068
- No, it can't end like this!
- Hey, wait!

21:19.236 --> 21:20.946
Young lady! Wait!

21:21.029 --> 21:23.031
I'm sure all of you are shocked,

21:23.115 --> 21:25.951
but I believe that we,
as the residents of Seyang Forest Le Ciel,

21:26.034 --> 21:29.371
can remain calm and overcome this crisis.

21:29.454 --> 21:31.123
It's not about remaining calm…

21:31.873 --> 21:34.334
I can't hear you
if you all talk at the same time.

21:34.418 --> 21:36.878
I will give you a chance to speak in turn.

21:38.130 --> 21:41.550
Is it because of someone
getting infected yesterday?

21:41.633 --> 21:45.429
Then they should separate those
who were in contact!

21:45.512 --> 21:47.389
I've never even seen that person!

21:49.725 --> 21:54.229
The lady from Unit 302 bumped
into the lady from Unit 601 and fell.

21:54.313 --> 21:56.148
Didn't you hear about it?

21:56.231 --> 21:57.065
Really?

21:57.649 --> 22:00.485
It seems your family hasn't had
any proper conversations.

22:00.569 --> 22:02.154
By the way…

22:02.237 --> 22:05.741
If it's contagious,
then we shouldn't gather like this, right?

22:05.824 --> 22:07.534
You watched the announcement.

22:07.617 --> 22:09.995
It doesn't spread through the air,
so don't worry.

22:10.078 --> 22:11.204
How can we believe that?

22:11.288 --> 22:14.416
But what happens
if someone's infected here,

22:14.499 --> 22:16.251
and tries to bite us?

22:19.004 --> 22:22.466
With all of us gathered up in this
small place, we will all bite and kill

22:22.549 --> 22:24.051
- and eat each other…
- Oh, my head.

22:24.134 --> 22:29.556
Honestly, I don't think there are
any more infected in our building.

22:29.639 --> 22:32.225
Everyone's sophisticated.

22:32.309 --> 22:35.062
And thankfully, we have a detective here.

22:36.146 --> 22:37.189
Detective.

22:39.399 --> 22:41.902
Don't look at me, I'm suffocating. You go.

22:48.450 --> 22:51.203
There are symptoms
that show before the disease occurs.

22:51.286 --> 22:54.915
The infected feel extreme thirst,
and the pupils get smaller,

22:54.998 --> 22:57.000
- making the eyes look white.
- What?

22:57.084 --> 22:58.919
And they also show compulsive behaviors

22:59.002 --> 23:01.630
like hitting the wall
when they're alone in an empty space.

23:01.713 --> 23:04.466
Please meet others
in a group of two or more

23:05.008 --> 23:08.011
and try to keep the doors open.

23:08.095 --> 23:11.139
If you see suspicious behavior,
ask for help right away.

23:11.223 --> 23:13.350
I live alone. How can I stay in groups?

23:13.433 --> 23:15.352
- Hold on.
- It's one week.

23:17.437 --> 23:20.899
You just need to endure this for one week.

23:47.717 --> 23:49.427
The kids were at school,

23:49.511 --> 23:51.930
and you stopped
the school buses from coming in.

23:53.306 --> 23:55.600
You wanted a lockdown without kids, right?

23:56.268 --> 23:57.978
It looks better that way.

23:59.229 --> 24:01.189
There's a kid who didn't go to school.

24:01.273 --> 24:02.482
Let her out.

24:03.066 --> 24:05.861
You can do that at least, right?

24:05.944 --> 24:07.070
Park Seo-yoon.

24:07.654 --> 24:08.947
We're testing her parents.

24:09.030 --> 24:10.824
They have a high risk of infection.

24:13.285 --> 24:14.161
Are you sure?

24:14.244 --> 24:16.371
I'm sure they took the drugs to stay awake

24:16.454 --> 24:18.165
because delivery work is tough.

24:18.832 --> 24:22.627
They're telling their daughter
that they love her and miss her, right?

24:23.879 --> 24:25.255
It's no use.

24:25.839 --> 24:28.633
You never know how people can change
in times of crisis.

24:30.552 --> 24:31.720
Lieutenant Colonel.

24:32.429 --> 24:35.682
You can talk about
your pessimistic views to someone else.

24:36.558 --> 24:37.517
So what?

24:40.437 --> 24:43.899
I'm saying it's better for Seo-yoon
to be here with a good guardian.

24:44.691 --> 24:45.901
We don't know…

24:50.030 --> 24:51.865
what will happen outside.

24:55.994 --> 24:57.204
Mr. Police Officer.

24:58.121 --> 25:03.376
I think I'll be able
to jump over the walls outside.

25:03.460 --> 25:07.047
Will I get punished if I jump over it?

25:07.714 --> 25:11.468
Well, the reporters
would love seeing that at least.

25:12.135 --> 25:14.679
If you're lucky, you might end up
on the evening news.

25:15.263 --> 25:18.308
- I see.
- What about food?

25:18.391 --> 25:20.685
Do we eat on our own?

25:20.769 --> 25:23.396
We'll give you boxed lunches,
starting tomorrow.

25:23.480 --> 25:25.273
Do you have enough food for dinner?

25:26.316 --> 25:28.944
But where are
the Management Office people?

25:29.027 --> 25:33.156
We got isolated at 9:30 a.m.,
but no one came to work by then.

25:33.240 --> 25:36.117
And the person on night duty
is at the other meeting.

25:36.201 --> 25:37.577
Absolutely ridiculous.

25:37.661 --> 25:39.537
What?

25:39.621 --> 25:43.375
Then are the other buildings
having a meeting without us?

25:43.458 --> 25:46.211
The first infected came from our building,
so they're scared.

25:46.294 --> 25:49.005
They are abandoning
their responsibilities.

25:49.673 --> 25:52.384
Then we have no one
from the Management Office here?

25:57.764 --> 25:59.099
No, we don't.

25:59.891 --> 26:02.769
Something unfathomable has happened.

26:03.270 --> 26:04.437
But she's right there.

26:09.234 --> 26:11.778
I was living in the US with my husband

26:11.861 --> 26:14.906
but returned because I fell in love with
the so-called K-Quarantine.

26:14.990 --> 26:16.616
Excuse me, building representative.

26:16.700 --> 26:19.160
We do have someone from
the Management Office, outside.

26:23.790 --> 26:26.918
Our apartment complex
teems with corruption.

26:27.002 --> 26:30.630
They secretly fixed the elevators
because they didn't pass the safety test.

26:30.714 --> 26:33.591
And they collect recyclables
only once a week,

26:33.675 --> 26:37.012
and they're wasting money to fix
the roadside trees in the complex.

26:37.095 --> 26:38.722
If you trust and follow me,

26:38.805 --> 26:42.434
I will become the resident representative

26:42.517 --> 26:46.813
and solve all these unreasonable issues
in the apartments.

26:48.273 --> 26:50.984
Then let the public rental floors
use the gym too.

26:52.277 --> 26:56.906
My husband graduated from
the College of Theology in Kentucky.

26:56.990 --> 26:59.200
- But I said…
- I know some of you are worried

26:59.284 --> 27:02.037
about worships
because the apartments are in quarantine.

27:02.954 --> 27:04.164
Hallelujah!

27:05.040 --> 27:09.127
- God is always with you.
- Amen.

27:09.961 --> 27:13.882
Believers, please come to me.

27:16.468 --> 27:19.346
If you're having difficulties calculating
your losses due to the lockdown

27:19.429 --> 27:22.474
or are in need of legal consulting,
please let me know.

27:22.557 --> 27:25.643
We will provide
high quality legal consulting service.

27:25.727 --> 27:27.228
Please come to Unit 602.

27:27.979 --> 27:29.356
Hey.

27:29.439 --> 27:30.690
Hurry up.

27:31.524 --> 27:33.193
I hate this.

27:40.200 --> 27:43.161
I heard you're also
something like a police officer.

27:43.745 --> 27:47.040
You should be cooperating
with maintaining order in the apartments.

27:47.123 --> 27:49.459
I'm in a completely different field.

27:49.542 --> 27:52.128
I only learned
how to suppress terrorist attacks.

27:52.212 --> 27:54.172
If you need cooperation, talk to me.

28:04.557 --> 28:06.351
Will I get a raise if I do this?

28:06.434 --> 28:07.519
I don't think so.

28:08.269 --> 28:10.480
But I'm sure it will help
with my promotion.

28:11.648 --> 28:13.316
Hey, I didn't know until I came here.

28:13.400 --> 28:15.568
I want to go home
and deliver rice cakes too.

28:15.652 --> 28:18.196
What is this about?

28:19.322 --> 28:21.866
You should tell me so I can help.

28:24.285 --> 28:26.913
- Why are you locking the door…
- Let us ask you something.

28:27.831 --> 28:29.249
Are you close to him?

28:29.332 --> 28:30.834
Joo-heon?

28:30.917 --> 28:34.170
No, I work every other day,
so I didn't even see him much.

28:34.254 --> 28:37.715
He stopped coming to work a few days ago,
so I've been filling in for him.

28:46.015 --> 28:48.143
You're drinking too much water.

28:48.727 --> 28:50.520
Do you keep feeling thirsty?

28:50.603 --> 28:52.272
I always drink a lot of water.

28:52.772 --> 28:54.107
Can you open this for us?

28:54.816 --> 28:56.317
I'm from the SOU.

28:57.736 --> 28:59.070
Okay.

29:00.822 --> 29:02.282
Look all you want.

29:07.328 --> 29:11.332
Your co-worker sold drugs here.

29:11.416 --> 29:15.253
And the government thinks
those drugs cause Mad Human Disease.

29:16.296 --> 29:17.714
You know the symptoms, right?

29:19.048 --> 29:20.133
Extreme thirst.

29:20.967 --> 29:21.843
Hallucinations.

29:27.599 --> 29:30.310
Be honest. Did you take those drugs?

29:30.393 --> 29:33.313
No, I only took supplements.

29:34.981 --> 29:36.566
But you know who took them, right?

29:37.317 --> 29:41.529
If you don't tell us now,
you could be charged with selling drugs.

29:42.405 --> 29:44.616
I really don't know.

29:44.699 --> 29:47.869
Hiding it won't solve anything.

29:47.952 --> 29:48.828
This entire complex

29:48.912 --> 29:50.955
is on lockdown because of you,
you know that?

29:51.039 --> 29:52.290
I told you, it wasn't me!

29:56.961 --> 30:03.009
You two keep talking
as if I'm the bad guy.

30:03.092 --> 30:05.720
But I seriously did not take those drugs.

30:23.905 --> 30:27.075
We're behind on
our cleaning schedule this week.

30:27.158 --> 30:29.202
Isn't there a way to solve this?

30:29.285 --> 30:30.119
SY HOME CLEANING

30:30.203 --> 30:34.457
Sir, I came in here
and suddenly got locked in too.

30:34.541 --> 30:38.044
They said they'll compensate
for financial losses, so let's be patient.

30:40.171 --> 30:42.924
Do you two have a place
to sleep, at least?

30:43.007 --> 30:44.259
No, we don't.

30:45.134 --> 30:47.345
I have a kid at home too.

30:47.929 --> 30:50.265
- How old is your kid?
- A sophomore in high school.

30:51.432 --> 30:52.684
A sophomore in high school…

30:54.185 --> 30:58.273
I will find out and see if you can sleep
at one of the houses you clean.

30:58.356 --> 31:01.359
By the way, is he from your company?

31:01.442 --> 31:04.571
He's our employee, but…

31:04.654 --> 31:05.613
What's your name?

31:07.407 --> 31:08.741
I'm Andrew.

31:08.825 --> 31:09.993
What?

31:10.702 --> 31:12.829
Excuse me.

31:17.834 --> 31:22.463
He's a bit dumb, but he's nice.

31:22.547 --> 31:25.550
He has a deep scar on his face
from an injury when he was little.

31:25.633 --> 31:28.177
So he couldn't go outside
and only stayed at home.

31:28.261 --> 31:31.556
But no one thinks it's weird
to wear a mask these days,

31:31.639 --> 31:34.017
so he mustered up the courage
to start working.

31:34.100 --> 31:35.143
I see.

31:36.269 --> 31:38.771
Do you all have your IDs with you?

31:38.855 --> 31:40.899
- Yes.
- Can you please give them to me?

31:40.982 --> 31:43.484
They said they need
a list of those who are inside.

31:50.825 --> 31:52.869
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD: AHN KOOK-JIN

31:52.952 --> 31:54.621
I erased it.

31:57.916 --> 31:59.959
Ahn Kook-jin.

32:00.960 --> 32:03.755
Why did you say your name was Andrew?

32:06.633 --> 32:08.801
Because I wish I could have superpowers.

32:09.385 --> 32:11.346
There was a TV show about it.

32:21.439 --> 32:24.817
Who were you calling,
and why did you hang up so quickly?

32:24.901 --> 32:26.945
I just called my friend.

32:27.570 --> 32:28.738
Shall we tie him up?

32:28.821 --> 32:30.239
We don't know yet.

32:30.323 --> 32:31.616
We won’t tie you up,

32:32.283 --> 32:33.785
so just stay here, okay?

32:33.868 --> 32:37.538
Mr. Kim, if we catch you outside,

32:37.622 --> 32:40.083
then we really will
consider you as an infected.

32:40.166 --> 32:41.334
As for water…

32:45.046 --> 32:46.506
Just hang on until morning.

32:52.971 --> 32:58.351
DO NOT ENTER
RISK OF INFECTION!

32:58.935 --> 33:00.269
You'll get thirsty if you stay up,

33:00.353 --> 33:02.438
so put the phone down and go to bed.

33:08.111 --> 33:09.237
UNIT 601
UNIT 1202

33:09.320 --> 33:10.154
UNIT 602

33:13.032 --> 33:15.785
It's a relief that
the public rental residents

33:15.868 --> 33:17.328
weren't allowed to use the gym.

33:17.412 --> 33:19.706
There's a fewer number of
possibly infected people.

33:21.207 --> 33:22.500
You truly are…

33:23.710 --> 33:24.794
a detective.

33:27.463 --> 33:28.297
Of course.

33:28.923 --> 33:31.217
I did go to the gym a few times,

33:31.300 --> 33:33.469
but besides that, I was always home.

33:33.553 --> 33:35.805
I won't leave my house
until the lockdown is over,

33:35.888 --> 33:36.931
so don't mind me.

33:37.015 --> 33:38.683
It's not about that.

33:39.600 --> 33:42.103
The people downstairs
need something, that's why.

33:43.354 --> 33:44.647
Blankets.

33:45.565 --> 33:47.316
You have military blankets, don't you?

33:52.155 --> 33:55.158
I can bring you the T-shirt tomorrow.

34:15.261 --> 34:16.387
Thank you.

34:20.433 --> 34:23.561
ARTICLE 1003
ORDER OF INHERITANCE OF SPOUSE

34:40.036 --> 34:41.996
You remember
that I live downstairs, right?

34:42.955 --> 34:46.042
If you make noises on purpose,
I'm coming for you.

34:48.795 --> 34:50.546
What are you going to do, then?

34:50.630 --> 34:51.547
Mister.

34:52.924 --> 34:55.635
Even if you die on the run,
no one would say anything.

34:55.718 --> 34:57.386
Lots of people would talk.

34:57.470 --> 34:59.597
This is illegal confinement.

35:00.723 --> 35:02.016
Well, more than that,

35:02.100 --> 35:04.393
your name wasn't on the gym register.

35:04.477 --> 35:06.479
Don't you exercise regularly?

35:06.562 --> 35:09.315
I breathe. And I play golf sometimes.

35:09.398 --> 35:11.109
My wife went to the gym.

35:14.112 --> 35:14.946
Why?

35:15.613 --> 35:19.117
Did Mad Human Disease spread from the gym?

35:19.200 --> 35:21.410
Stop trying to play tricks

35:22.203 --> 35:24.622
and just repent your murder
if you have time for that.

35:25.498 --> 35:27.083
If you're a human being, at least.

35:32.880 --> 35:35.591
Ms. Woo, we prepared
a change of clothes for you

35:35.675 --> 35:38.136
and a place to sleep on the fifth floor,
so come with me.

35:38.886 --> 35:40.596
I just want to stay here.

35:41.222 --> 35:44.600
I got angry and gave false testimony.

35:45.518 --> 35:49.188
To be honest,
I didn’t see or hear anything that day.

35:49.272 --> 35:50.898
I'm sorry, Detective.

35:50.982 --> 35:53.818
Sang-hee got tricked by you

35:53.901 --> 35:56.696
and thought that I really did something.

35:58.573 --> 36:02.702
I explained to her that
Min-ji's death was an accident.

36:24.932 --> 36:26.851
LIEUTENANT COLONEL HAN TAE-SEOK

36:31.230 --> 36:32.064
What is it?

36:32.148 --> 36:34.734
Unit 302 is livestreaming
about what's happening in the apartment.

36:34.817 --> 36:36.319
Stop him immediately.

36:36.402 --> 36:38.946
If not, we will cut off the Internet
and all TV signals.

36:55.671 --> 36:59.550
Hey, get up for a minute.

37:00.259 --> 37:02.261
Why?

37:02.345 --> 37:03.387
Did you…

37:05.097 --> 37:06.557
meet someone infected yesterday?

37:07.934 --> 37:09.644
Did you figure that out now?

37:12.396 --> 37:14.899
- Did you get scratched?
- No, I didn't.

37:16.108 --> 37:17.693
Yes, you did.

37:17.777 --> 37:19.612
My goodness.

37:20.238 --> 37:21.614
Stop it!

37:21.697 --> 37:23.908
I said I didn't!

37:25.618 --> 37:28.204
Pretending to be concerned
when you never bothered before.

37:30.623 --> 37:33.626
You were lying down for this?
It's not even serious.

37:34.794 --> 37:37.755
Just drink some soju.
If you drink, the pain will go away.

37:37.838 --> 37:39.131
Gosh.

37:44.595 --> 37:45.805
What is it?

37:45.888 --> 37:47.181
Is your son home?

37:47.265 --> 37:49.225
I think he went outside earlier.

37:49.308 --> 37:50.685
Do you know where he went to?

37:50.768 --> 37:52.228
I'm sure he's in the complex.

37:52.311 --> 37:54.063
Anyway, he's not here.

37:57.108 --> 37:58.150
I know where he is.

37:58.234 --> 38:01.737
I told you, I won't be talking
about stocks today.

38:01.821 --> 38:04.115
Today's contents are real, no fabrication.

38:04.198 --> 38:06.659
Giro, good to see you.

38:06.742 --> 38:09.328
It's Giro, our biggest sponsor.
Good to see you!

38:09.412 --> 38:13.416
All right, everyone.
Can you guess where this is?

38:15.293 --> 38:18.087
This is where
the first infected person was found.

38:19.672 --> 38:21.841
The family is still living here,

38:21.924 --> 38:24.593
so I'm going to meet and talk to them.

38:27.096 --> 38:29.890
Shall I ring the doorbell?

38:30.725 --> 38:32.143
Ring it? Or not?

38:33.185 --> 38:34.979
Ring it? Or not?

38:36.689 --> 38:38.190
Shall I ring it, or not?

38:38.274 --> 38:39.108
JUST RING IT ALREADY

38:39.191 --> 38:40.526
Ring it or not?

38:40.609 --> 38:43.612
- Oh, my gosh…
- Shall I punch him? Or not?

38:43.696 --> 38:46.782
Punch him? Or not?

38:46.866 --> 38:49.660
I'm getting lots! Lots!

38:49.744 --> 38:52.079
We're turning this off.
Go to bed, everyone.

38:52.163 --> 38:53.748
What the heck? How do I turn this off?

38:53.831 --> 38:56.500
- Streaming off!
- What is this?

38:57.293 --> 38:58.461
Thank you.

38:58.544 --> 39:00.463
Is this something you should thank us for?

39:00.546 --> 39:03.549
- I got 500,000 won!
- This is driving me nuts…

39:07.053 --> 39:08.429
- Damn it!
- Why did you do that?

39:08.512 --> 39:10.014
Mister, come here.

39:14.185 --> 39:17.021
Today's been such a long day.

39:17.104 --> 39:18.773
Right.

39:18.856 --> 39:21.359
What about the clinic consultant upstairs?

39:21.442 --> 39:24.320
She got coaxed by Oh Joo-hyung.
She said she'll just stay there.

39:26.030 --> 39:28.074
Should we try persuading her again?

39:28.157 --> 39:31.160
No, she's an adult.
She can make her own decisions.

39:31.243 --> 39:33.954
I'm sure Oh Joo-hyung
won't cause any more trouble.

39:34.038 --> 39:36.707
Let's just check on them
from time to time.

39:36.791 --> 39:39.043
- I'm so tired.
- All right, then.

39:39.877 --> 39:42.296
About our beds…

39:43.464 --> 39:44.965
Where should we…

39:48.219 --> 39:49.929
Where should I sleep?

40:22.002 --> 40:24.547
Hey, Yi-hyun. Smile.

40:24.630 --> 40:25.673
All right. One, two.

40:28.134 --> 40:29.343
What are you doing?

40:30.177 --> 40:34.432
My wife told me to send her a picture.
She thinks I went fishing.

40:34.515 --> 40:36.475
Why won't she believe me?

40:36.559 --> 40:38.185
I can't believe it, either.

40:38.769 --> 40:40.146
Can't believe what?

40:40.229 --> 40:42.106
That I'm here with you right now.

40:43.941 --> 40:46.318
Things seemed so nice today…

40:47.862 --> 40:49.113
There you go.

40:49.697 --> 40:50.531
Here.

40:51.824 --> 40:53.742
You just need to wait for a few more days,

40:53.826 --> 40:56.745
so think of it as staying
at a vacation house, okay?

40:56.829 --> 40:57.746
Okay.

41:12.094 --> 41:13.262
Are you praying?

41:14.930 --> 41:17.266
I changed my prayer today.

41:17.349 --> 41:20.311
I prayed that the lockdown
would be over when I wake up tomorrow.

41:21.562 --> 41:23.898
Right. I'll pray for that too.

41:24.940 --> 41:26.734
- Good night.
- Okay.

41:27.568 --> 41:29.820
You have a good night too.

41:29.904 --> 41:31.071
Let's have a good night.

41:35.242 --> 41:36.285
Yi-hyun.

41:38.120 --> 41:39.121
What?

41:39.205 --> 41:40.831
I have a bad back.

41:44.793 --> 41:47.463
- All of a sudden?
- Yes.

41:50.174 --> 41:53.010
Jeez. You can sleep on the sofa.

41:53.093 --> 41:54.261
Thanks.

41:59.266 --> 42:02.394
- This is mine, so take that one.
- Okay, thanks.

42:05.481 --> 42:07.858
I got treated by a bad acupuncturist.

42:28.587 --> 42:32.258
I'M SORRY I KEEP CALLING YOU
WHEN YOU MUST BE WORRIED TOO

42:32.341 --> 42:33.884
CONGRATULATIONS ON YOUR MARRIAGE

42:33.968 --> 42:36.095
EVERYTHING WILL BE FINE, SO DON'T WORRY

42:36.178 --> 42:40.015
STAY HEALTHY
DON'T BECOME LIKE ME, AND BE HAPPY!

42:52.027 --> 42:55.739
YOU SHOULD BE HAPPY TOO, MOM

43:00.452 --> 43:02.746
COUNT ON US FOR
A CURE FOR VIRAL PNEUMONIA

43:06.083 --> 43:09.044
THE DARK SIDE OF ATUM THERAPEUTICS,
TEAM LEADER HAN TAE-SEOK ASSAULTS CEO

43:10.170 --> 43:11.171
Jung-kook.

43:11.964 --> 43:13.382
I know you’re not asleep.

43:15.718 --> 43:18.429
- What?
- About Han Tae-seok's assault…

43:20.055 --> 43:21.932
What happened to the CEO of that company?

43:22.016 --> 43:23.434
What are you talking about?

43:24.018 --> 43:26.353
If it was an assault,
that means he's not dead.

43:29.356 --> 43:31.650
So I'm wondering
what happened to him after that.

43:57.843 --> 43:58.886
DOMESTIC AND FOREIGN MARKET TRENDS

44:04.099 --> 44:05.726
You look well, Mr. Choi.

44:05.809 --> 44:09.188
I heard you revealed Mad Human Disease
and locked the apartments down.

44:09.271 --> 44:10.564
It's chaos worldwide.

44:10.648 --> 44:13.359
The article will be released tomorrow
and the borders will be closed.

44:15.861 --> 44:17.780
I recommended you to the higher-ups

44:17.863 --> 44:20.199
because you said
you could take care of it quietly.

44:20.783 --> 44:22.701
I'm sure they'll be disappointed.

44:24.953 --> 44:27.164
Someone was releasing Next
into the market.

44:27.247 --> 44:28.582
That's why I failed.

44:29.375 --> 44:30.209
Who?

44:35.506 --> 44:36.674
You.

44:37.800 --> 44:39.551
You took out all of the stock

44:40.177 --> 44:41.679
left in the storage, didn't you?

44:42.262 --> 44:43.639
I didn't buy those.

44:44.640 --> 44:48.477
Someone told me where the storage was
and told me to take them all.

44:50.562 --> 44:51.730
Why would I do that?

44:51.814 --> 44:55.484
Because the more infected there are,
the faster the cure can be developed.

44:55.567 --> 44:58.695
Aren't you the type
who would rather see the world end

44:58.779 --> 45:00.489
than face your death?

45:02.616 --> 45:03.909
Tae-seok.

45:06.203 --> 45:08.664
Your wife's life also depends on this.

45:09.248 --> 45:11.708
And the baby is still in her womb, right?

45:13.919 --> 45:16.046
Two tenacious lives.

45:21.885 --> 45:24.471
Did you know that
your wife's blood tasted the best?

45:31.937 --> 45:32.896
That thirst…

45:33.814 --> 45:35.399
it's hard to hold it in, isn't it?

46:00.674 --> 46:02.009
Lieutenant Colonel.

46:08.724 --> 46:09.808
It's okay.

46:21.028 --> 46:22.946
That old man did release it.

46:23.030 --> 46:25.574
I'll get the numbers of his entourages.
Track them down.

46:25.657 --> 46:27.910
We must block
all possible routes of infection.

46:27.993 --> 46:29.745
Is it okay to leave him like that?

46:29.828 --> 46:32.539
Do you have an alternative?

46:32.623 --> 46:34.249
We should quarantine him too.

46:34.333 --> 46:36.084
His status is way too high for that.

46:36.668 --> 46:39.087
Once the cure is developed,
he'll get the shot first.

46:39.796 --> 46:42.174
Even if he gets cured,
he might still bite people.

46:42.841 --> 46:44.009
Because he's tasted blood

46:45.135 --> 46:47.179
and learned that he can get away with it.

46:47.262 --> 46:50.224
- Then we should…
- The most important thing is the cure.

46:53.602 --> 46:55.354
Whether or not he survives after that…

46:58.440 --> 46:59.775
is a whole different matter.

47:17.668 --> 47:19.461
It's still the same.

47:19.545 --> 47:21.046
This morning, the government announced

47:21.129 --> 47:25.050
that they put two more nursing homes
into cohort isolation.

47:25.551 --> 47:27.970
Places in cohort isolation include
one apartment complex,

47:28.053 --> 47:31.473
three nursing homes,
and two homeless shelters,

47:31.557 --> 47:34.560
making it a total of eight
in only two days.

47:35.143 --> 47:36.687
There are also suspicions

47:36.770 --> 47:39.439
of Mad Human Disease
spreading overseas as well.

47:39.523 --> 47:42.317
Russia closed its borders
due to infectious disease,

47:42.401 --> 47:43.402
and its customs…

47:44.611 --> 47:46.154
Did you sleep well?

47:46.238 --> 47:47.197
Of course.

47:47.281 --> 47:49.116
Did you sleep well too, Mister?

47:49.199 --> 47:50.200
Yes.

47:51.827 --> 47:52.869
Let's go.

47:53.453 --> 47:55.455
- Go where?
- To get boxed lunches!

47:55.539 --> 47:56.832
Right.

47:56.915 --> 47:58.166
Hi.

47:58.250 --> 48:00.419
- You're up, Seo-yoon.
- Hi.

48:00.502 --> 48:02.004
- Did you have a good sleep?
- Yes.

48:02.963 --> 48:06.258
Sae-bom, you look really happy today.

48:07.884 --> 48:10.178
Yi-hyun was tossing
and turning all night long.

48:13.473 --> 48:17.894
People are happy when
they are looking forward to something.

48:17.978 --> 48:18.854
What do you mean?

48:18.937 --> 48:21.189
Aren't you curious
what kind of food they'll give us?

48:22.566 --> 48:23.567
Right.

48:24.151 --> 48:26.028
Why?

48:27.821 --> 48:31.450
I bought this apartment with my money!
Why can't I go out?

48:31.533 --> 48:33.118
Open it!

48:33.201 --> 48:36.580
Sir, you're a public rental resident.

48:36.663 --> 48:38.915
You got in here with the taxes I paid.

48:39.750 --> 48:42.544
I'm still a resident here!

48:42.628 --> 48:44.880
Damn it!

48:44.963 --> 48:47.758
They're from the Management Office
and the other buildings.

48:47.841 --> 48:49.343
What's going on?

48:49.426 --> 48:51.011
We can't go outside anymore.

48:51.094 --> 48:52.721
The other buildings voted for this.

48:52.804 --> 48:53.889
Lock it up.

48:57.017 --> 48:58.685
What do you think you're doing?

48:59.603 --> 49:02.856
This is all because
there was someone infected here!

49:02.939 --> 49:06.818
I heard you also locked up
someone infected in the gym!

49:07.444 --> 49:08.820
How do you know about that?

49:08.904 --> 49:11.073
We can see it from the Management Office.

49:12.366 --> 49:14.785
So you've been spying on our building?

49:15.702 --> 49:17.746
For the sake of
this entire apartment complex,

49:17.829 --> 49:20.248
the residents of this building…

49:21.166 --> 49:22.751
should stay home for a week!

49:24.670 --> 49:25.545
And our lunches?

49:25.629 --> 49:28.006
We'll bring the necessities for you.

49:28.590 --> 49:30.967
It's hard for all of us. Don't do this.

49:31.051 --> 49:34.096
It's not like you can get infected
through airborne transmission.

49:34.680 --> 49:37.015
This building has
the most public rentals, right?

49:37.099 --> 49:37.974
Yes.

49:38.058 --> 49:40.310
What does that have to do with this?

49:41.269 --> 49:43.271
It means it's unfair for us!

49:43.355 --> 49:45.941
If more people get infected
and the apartment price drops,

49:46.024 --> 49:47.943
- it'll only damage us!
- That's right!

49:48.985 --> 49:51.905
You can just live here for ten years
and buy it for a low price!

49:51.988 --> 49:54.825
Are you doing this on purpose?

49:54.908 --> 49:57.119
Mr. Kim, please help.

49:58.745 --> 50:01.623
I can't even persuade my wife.

50:01.707 --> 50:04.501
They told us not to go outside,
so let's not go outside.

50:04.584 --> 50:05.961
Not that.

50:06.044 --> 50:07.504
- Let me borrow your gun.
- Hey!

50:13.135 --> 50:15.721
Want me to break out,
or will you just open it?

50:16.763 --> 50:18.557
The key.

50:21.810 --> 50:24.730
Seo-yoon, you must never learn
to do things like that.

50:25.814 --> 50:27.232
She's so awesome.

50:36.908 --> 50:39.202
Every day I'm losing my love for humanity.

50:39.870 --> 50:41.913
We just need to hold on for six more days.

50:41.997 --> 50:44.249
How is time flowing slower
than during our drills?

50:56.511 --> 50:57.929
You people are so heartless.

50:59.514 --> 51:02.392
We made these boxed lunches
with extra care, though.

51:02.476 --> 51:03.769
With lots of protein.

51:10.442 --> 51:12.444
What about the other buildings?
Is this it?

51:12.527 --> 51:15.822
They said they'll take theirs
after your building residents are gone.

51:17.407 --> 51:19.951
Sometimes they're brave,
and sometimes they're cowardly.

51:20.035 --> 51:22.621
Human beings are just so puzzling.

51:23.789 --> 51:25.290
Did you bring enough?

51:26.082 --> 51:27.793
We'll take these and go inside first.

51:30.420 --> 51:31.713
Go inside and wait.

51:31.797 --> 51:33.882
- Okay.
- Seo-yoon, let's go.

51:36.134 --> 51:37.636
Do you need anything else?

51:38.637 --> 51:40.514
Then…

51:40.597 --> 51:42.808
A T-shirt. Large-sized, for men.

51:43.391 --> 51:45.435
Something that looks extremely rare.

51:45.519 --> 51:47.604
With the logo of a special unit…

51:49.397 --> 51:52.108
You don't have an SOU T-shirt, do you?

51:54.861 --> 51:57.072
Are you the only one working here?

51:57.155 --> 52:00.742
Yes, the owner and his wife
went out to get things, so…

52:02.536 --> 52:03.829
Not much is left.

52:03.912 --> 52:06.164
The other buildings bought
everything last night.

52:06.248 --> 52:08.416
A few from Building 101 bought stuff too.

52:10.377 --> 52:13.463
You're pretty calm
considering the situation.

52:14.214 --> 52:16.091
I'm getting three times my original wage.

52:16.174 --> 52:17.551
If I work for 12 hours a day

52:17.634 --> 52:20.387
and get paid for working on holidays,
it'll be a huge amount.

52:21.471 --> 52:23.098
Aren't you scared to be alone here?

52:24.099 --> 52:27.185
I'm sure they'd go mad in their homes,
not at a supermarket.

52:27.269 --> 52:29.271
When we run out of stock,
I'll lock the door.

52:38.488 --> 52:39.406
No parcel deliveries?

52:40.115 --> 52:42.576
I was supposed to get something today.

52:42.659 --> 52:43.702
Bye.

52:47.455 --> 52:48.498
I'm vegetarian.

52:49.124 --> 52:50.834
Isn't there a vegetarian option?

52:50.917 --> 52:52.544
- Vegetarian?
- Yes.

52:52.627 --> 52:55.005
Just take it and shove it in your mouth.

53:00.635 --> 53:01.511
ARMED FORCES MEDICAL COMMAND

53:01.595 --> 53:03.096
It's genuine.

53:03.179 --> 53:04.389
I know someone there.

53:04.472 --> 53:08.226
And I'll get you the SOU T-shirt
when the lockdown ends.

53:11.688 --> 53:13.899
- I like it.
- Right?

53:16.401 --> 53:19.321
Have you been on the rooftop?

53:25.493 --> 53:27.704
- It's nice to be out here, right?
- Yes.

53:45.347 --> 53:47.724
It's nice to be in an open space.

53:49.017 --> 53:50.602
It feels like we're on a picnic.

53:51.102 --> 53:51.978
Right.

53:53.104 --> 53:54.898
Let's stay like this for a while.

54:15.335 --> 54:18.713
- Let's eat.
- Let's eat.

54:18.797 --> 54:20.382
Help yourself, Seo-yoon.

54:20.465 --> 54:22.133
This is actually pretty good.

54:22.217 --> 54:23.134
- It's good.
- Yes.

54:23.218 --> 54:24.803
Have some more of these.

54:24.886 --> 54:26.054
Thanks.

54:27.305 --> 54:29.140
- Jung-kook, have some dumplings.
- Thanks.

54:32.978 --> 54:34.729
Eat up, Seo-yoon.

54:36.856 --> 54:37.983
What?

55:11.599 --> 55:13.476
We have three boxed lunches left.

55:15.020 --> 55:17.022
Are you sure you passed them
out to everyone?

55:17.105 --> 55:19.899
Yes, even the cleaning lady took hers.

55:22.110 --> 55:23.069
Right.

55:25.030 --> 55:25.947
The gym.

55:29.409 --> 55:31.494
Mr. Kim, we're sorry.

55:31.578 --> 55:33.538
You should've called
and told us you're hungry…

55:38.460 --> 55:40.253
That punk must have run away.

56:01.900 --> 56:02.776
Hello?

56:02.859 --> 56:04.736
The guy in the gym disappeared.

56:04.819 --> 56:07.072
Make an announcement
and tell everyone to go home.

56:07.864 --> 56:10.325
I was just about to tell you this.

56:10.408 --> 56:12.619
The Management Office
won't answer the phone.

56:12.702 --> 56:14.245
They must be upset
about what happened earlier.

56:14.329 --> 56:16.998
They're trying to have
a meeting without us again.

56:17.082 --> 56:18.708
Okay, I'll call them then.

56:18.792 --> 56:19.959
What? Hello?

56:21.503 --> 56:24.089
Does this jerk think he's above me?

56:24.172 --> 56:26.091
That worthless cop…

56:26.800 --> 56:28.134
EMERGENCY CONTACT NETWORK

56:33.515 --> 56:38.728
A SHELTER IN THE MIDDLE OF A BUSY CITY
WELCOME, NEW RESIDENTS

56:42.065 --> 56:43.483
Hey, where are you going?

56:48.655 --> 56:50.532
They're not answering. What should we do?

56:50.615 --> 56:51.866
Where are you going?

56:59.332 --> 57:01.167
I'm sure he's hiding here somewhere.

57:12.554 --> 57:13.847
Wrong card.

57:29.529 --> 57:30.530
Let's go inside.

57:42.250 --> 57:43.418
Is he here?

57:43.501 --> 57:44.752
No, he isn't.

57:48.423 --> 57:49.632
What is that?

57:54.929 --> 57:55.847
Hey!

58:00.685 --> 58:02.103
It's blood.

58:13.656 --> 58:15.867
- Let's go.
- Let me see what's going on first.

58:15.950 --> 58:16.951
Sae-bom!

58:17.035 --> 58:19.162
I don't want to get scared
without knowing what’s going on.

58:56.533 --> 58:58.785
Hey Mister, come out!

58:58.868 --> 59:01.829
- Shouldn't we take him?
- Come out if you don't want to die!

59:02.413 --> 59:03.581
Damn it.

59:13.132 --> 59:14.217
Why isn't this working?

59:14.300 --> 59:16.135
Please try again.

59:20.723 --> 59:21.849
Thank you.

59:33.778 --> 59:34.779
What?

59:34.862 --> 59:36.322
What's wrong?

59:36.406 --> 59:37.865
I…

59:37.949 --> 59:39.867
I really just went to my car for a moment.

59:39.951 --> 59:41.661
I didn't drink water.

59:41.744 --> 59:43.037
Then why were you running?

59:43.121 --> 59:45.206
I ran because you two ran.

59:45.290 --> 59:46.874
Let me go, please!

59:47.542 --> 59:48.835
Come on.

59:52.255 --> 59:53.506
Can you see them?

59:53.590 --> 59:55.883
See what? Is something out there?

59:57.510 --> 59:59.596
This is crazy…

01:00:08.980 --> 01:00:09.856
Let's go up.

01:00:14.527 --> 01:00:15.695
Help!

01:00:15.778 --> 01:00:17.989
Help me, please!

01:01:28.059 --> 01:01:29.102
Ma'am!

01:01:29.185 --> 01:01:30.436
Are you okay?

01:01:30.520 --> 01:01:33.398
I'm fine but the couple from that house…

01:01:42.824 --> 01:01:45.576
Mom, I'm doing fine.

01:02:13.813 --> 01:02:15.898
MOM, I'M DOING FINE

01:02:17.775 --> 01:02:22.447
MOM: SEO-YOON, I LOVE YOU…

01:02:29.162 --> 01:02:30.163
Hey!

01:02:30.246 --> 01:02:32.749
This is our chance.

01:02:32.832 --> 01:02:34.000
Yes.

01:02:34.083 --> 01:02:36.461
I'm sure Hyun-kyung
is feeling troubled too.

01:02:37.170 --> 01:02:40.381
Let's stay strong, okay?

01:02:41.007 --> 01:02:43.509
Hey, we have to find a house
within two months!

01:02:44.302 --> 01:02:46.554
Where will you live with our kids, then?

01:02:47.180 --> 01:02:48.723
A tiny studio?

01:02:50.391 --> 01:02:52.018
Ma'am, you shouldn't go outside.

01:03:00.401 --> 01:03:02.069
Stay still. If you run away again…

01:03:07.325 --> 01:03:08.659
What are you doing?

01:03:08.743 --> 01:03:10.995
- Is something going on?
- Be quiet.

01:03:19.045 --> 01:03:20.588
LIEUTENANT COLONEL HAN TAE-SEOK

01:03:26.636 --> 01:03:28.304
Ms. Yoon, are you all right?

01:03:30.139 --> 01:03:32.725
Now do you see
why a lockdown is necessary?

01:03:51.202 --> 01:03:54.330
Who's that?

01:04:06.551 --> 01:04:08.719
The other buildings are all done for.

01:04:08.803 --> 01:04:09.679
I know.

01:05:00.980 --> 01:05:03.441
If it's dangerous,
you shouldn't hesitate either.

01:05:03.524 --> 01:05:04.567
Don't open the door.

01:05:04.650 --> 01:05:07.236
But they all got infected already?
That makes no sense!

01:05:07.904 --> 01:05:10.448
What if this doesn't end
even after one week?

01:05:10.531 --> 01:05:12.283
We have to have as much food as possible.

01:05:12.366 --> 01:05:13.409
Instant noodles.

01:05:15.161 --> 01:05:17.622
We just need to silence
the couple downstairs.

01:05:18.706 --> 01:05:19.749
Are you thirsty?

01:05:20.499 --> 01:05:22.418
We should not let them pity the infected.

01:05:22.501 --> 01:05:23.920
We must make them fear them.

01:05:24.003 --> 01:05:24.921
Open the door!

01:05:25.671 --> 01:05:27.089
If you're a human being,

01:05:27.173 --> 01:05:29.592
you should have responsibility
at the very least.

01:05:31.886 --> 01:05:36.891
Subtitle translation by: Hae-lim Lee
